    "chunk_text": ". JU16A7 \u00d0a hi \u00fe\u00e6t ne ge\u00feafedon, \u00fea het he him \u00f0a tungan forceorfan, ac hi spr\u00e6con butan tungan, JU16A10 \u00d0a het he hi slean mid sweorde, ond hi \u00fea onsendon heora gastas, ond \u00fe\u00e6r com micel JU16A12 Ond cristne men bebyrgdon heora lichoman on \u00f0\u00e6m ylcan scr\u00e6fe \u00fe\u00e6r hi \u00e6r gode JU17A1 On \u00f0one seofonteg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Nicandes tid \u00fe\u00e6s martyres, \u00f0\u00e6s gemynd JU17A4 Ond on \u00feone ylcan d\u00e6g bid sancte Blastes \u00f0rowung \u00fe\u00e6s martyres on Rome, se \u00ferowade JU18A1 On \u00f0one eahtateg\u00fean d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00feara \u00e6\u00feelra wera \u00f0rowung sancte Marces ond JU18A3 \u00de\u00e6t w\u00e6ron gebro\u00fera, ond hi w\u00e6ron begen cristene. JU18A4 \u00dea bebead Dioclitianus se casere \u00f0\u00e6t hi guldon deofolgyld o\u00fe\u00fee hi man beheafdade. JU18A6 \u00d0a hi \u00fea eodon to \u00fe\u00e6re beheafdunga, \u00fea com him ongean wepende f\u00e6der ond modor ond JU18A9 \u00d0a oncierde him seo gehygd to deofolgylde. JU18A10 \u00dea ongeat \u00fe\u00e6t sanctus Sebastianus se cristna wer. JU18A12 \u00d0a ongan he him secgan hu lytel ond hu scomlic \u00f0\u00e6s mannes lif bi\u00f0 her on worolde, ond JU19A1 On \u00f0one nygenteg\u00f0an d\u00e6g \u00f0\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00feara haligra gebro\u00f0ra tid sancte Geruasi ond",
